      "text": "She didn’t just steal it. She planned to poop it out. 🤮\n\nManila airport. A security officer caught on camera stuffing $300 in cash down her throat like it was a chocolate bar.\nWhy?\nBecause she got busted stealing from a passenger’s wallet and thought she could hide the evidence in her stomach.\nYou read that right.\nShe swallowed the cash…\nwith help from coworkers who handed her water to wash it down.\nNo escape plan.\nNo exit strategy.\nJust raw desperation and a hope it’d reappear in a toilet bowl two days later.\nThey didn’t just fire her.\nThey banned pockets in the entire airport.",
